      "widgets_values": [
        "GENESIS KLEIN 9B-KV + LoRA + ReActor\n\nThe installed LoRAs are labelled Klein 4B or FLUX.1 and are NOT enabled for this 9B workflow. Both LoRA slots use strength 0, so they safely pass the model and text encoder through.\n\nTo use LoRAs: install LoRAs explicitly trained for FLUX.2 Klein 9B/KV, refresh ComfyUI, choose them in Slot 1/2, then raise model strength gradually (start 0.4-0.7). Leave CLIP strength at 0 unless the LoRA author says otherwise.\n\nRX 9060 XT 16GB starting point: 768x768, batch 1, 6-8 steps, CFG 1.0. ReActor remains after VAE Decode. Your 4B workflow is unchanged."
      ]
    }
